\begin_layout Plain Layout
Sarsa-75 implementation outperforms the maximum velocity solution in 100
 episodes, except for one outlier.
 The Sarsa approach represents a strongly random exploratory approach that
 tries out and optimises many things but does not represent a strategy that
 works intrinsically.
 
