\begin_layout Subsubsection
Mountain car Summmary / Analysis
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The familiar solutions were superior to the scratch solutions in all respects.
 Die scratch-Lösung war more secure and were able to achieve the goal more
 easily in the online evaluation.
 The candidates were even able to reduce the regression error better, which
 is a big surprise in view of the reduced degree of freedom.
 The extraordinary performance can probably be explained by the optimised
 search space, which could be reduced to an efficient and smaller space
 by the expert's specification.
\end_layout

