\begin_layout Paragraph
IB summary
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The regression error of no run was able to reach the neuropolicy data set
 sufficiently; for MSE runs the limit was about 2, for MAE runs about 1.5.
 Thus even the best candidates are about 5 times worse than comparable candidate
s of the MC benchmark.
 There can be many reasons for this poor performance, the most likely being
 that the PSONN policy is too complex as a black box to be sufficiently
 approximated by genetic programming.
 This is also confirmed by the results of 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "daniel_hein_doktorarbeit"
literal "false"

\end_inset

, where the regression error also did not fall significantly below a limit
 of 2.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Since the candidates cannot expect any performance gain, their evaluation
 would not be meaningful.
 
\end_layout

